From: Aspartame GTK4 migration
Subject: [PATCH] Wire GTK4 Activity sharing to the presence service

The GTK4 toolkit already ships the Telepathy presence implementation, but
Activity.share() and Activity._set_up_sharing() were still stubs.  Port the
small GTK3 Activity contract to that backend so the Share palette can perform
a real share and invited/resumed Activities can rejoin an existing activity.

If the presence service is unavailable, keep the Activity usable in private
mode and let the Share palette's existing refusal path report the failure.

